downReductionPercent\":10,\"ManaPerTime\":2},\"passive\":\"Adaptive Stat: +15 Strength or +25 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\n+0.4 Mana per second per 10% of missing Mana.\\n\\nRequires Level 20 to upgrade.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Adaptive Stat: +15 Strength or +25 Intelligence (based on highest item stat).\\n\\n+0.4 Mana per second per 10% of missing Mana.\\n\\nRequires Level 20 to upgrade.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":650,\"isLegacy\":false},\"f80c701c-173b-4a84-926d-e569028d3ed4\":{\"slug\":\"purification-beads\",\"name\":\"Purification Beads\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/Utility/T_Icon_Utility_PurificationBeads.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Relic\",\"stats\":{},\"passive\":null,\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":\"On Use: Immune to Crowd Control for 2s.\\n\\nCooldown: 150s\",\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"On Use: Immune to Crowd Control for 2s.\\n\\nCooldown: 150s\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":0,\"isLegacy\":false},\"d7ae4e75-39a3-4aef-9bb7-e12d37df5a36\":{\"slug\":\"bancrofts-talon\",\"name\":\"Bancroft's Talon\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_BancroftsTalon.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"MagicalPower\":55,\"LifeStealPercent\":7.5,\"ManaPerTime\":2,\"MaxMana\":150},\"passive\":\"Gain bonus Intelligence and Lifesteal scaled from missing Health.\\n• Caps at +60 Intelligence and +10% Lifesteal at 40% Health\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Gain bonus Intelligence and Lifesteal scaled from missing Health.\\n• Caps at +60 Intelligence and +10% Lifesteal at 40% Health\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2300,\"isLegacy\":false},\"b93cda9f-c056-46c2-9d47-d885a696b5d4\":{\"slug\":\"book-of-thoth\",\"name\":\"Book of Thoth\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_BookofThroth.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"MagicalPower\":30,\"ManaPerTime\":4,\"MaxMana\":350},\"passive\":\"+Intelligence equal to 5% of Mana from Items.\\n\\nDeal 900 Damage to Minions or Jungle Monsters:\\n+1 Evolve Stack\\n+1 Mana Infusion Stack (Max 50 Stacks)\\n• Damage dealt to Gods counts double\\n\\nPer Mana Infusion Stack: +10 Mana.\\n\\nAt 50 Evolve Stacks, Item evolves and gains:\\n• Additional +Intelligence equal to 2% of Mana from Items\\n• +5 Penetration\\n• +100 Mana\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"+Intelligence equal to 5% of Mana from Items.\\n\\nDeal 900 Damage to Minions or Jungle Monsters:\\n+1 Evolve Stack\\n+1 Mana Infusion Stack (Max 50 Stacks)\\n• Damage dealt to Gods counts double\\n\\nPer Mana Infusion Stack: +10 Mana.\\n\\nAt 50 Evolve Stacks, Item evolves and gains:\\n• Additional +Intelligence equal to 2% of Mana from Items\\n• +5 Penetration\\n• +100 Mana\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2300,\"isLegacy\":false},\"151c5e85-8d27-4380-8713-b07c68caebd3\":{\"slug\":\"typhons-heart\",\"name\":\"Typhon's Heart\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_TyphonsHeart.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"MagicalPower\":80,\"LifeStealPercent\":7.5},\"passive\":\"On Minion or Jungle Kill: +1 Stack\\nOn God Kill: +30 Stacks\\nOn Assist: +15 Stacks\\n\\nAt 30 Stacks: Summon a Monster of Typhon\\n• Health = 200 (+55 per Level)\\n• Damage = 300% of your Lifesteal and 30% of your Intelligence\\n• Your Lifesteal heals the monster\\n\\nIf another would be summoned:\\n• Fully Heal current monster\\n• Buff it with +25% Health, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed (Stacks up to 5x)\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"On Minion or Jungle Kill: +1 Stack\\nOn God Kill: +30 Stacks\\nOn Assist: +15 Stacks\\n\\nAt 30 Stacks: Summon a Monster of Typhon\\n• Health = 200 (+55 per Level)\\n• Damage = 300% of your Lifesteal and 30% of your Intelligence\\n• Your Lifesteal heals the monster\\n\\nIf another would be summoned:\\n• Fully Heal current monster\\n