ive\":\"+Intelligence equal to 5% of Mana from Items.\\n\\nDeal 900 Damage to Minions or Jungle Monsters:\\n+1 Evolve Stack\\n+1 Mana Infusion Stack (Max 50 Stacks)\\n• Damage dealt to Gods counts double\\n\\nPer Mana Infusion Stack: +10 Mana.\\n\\nAt 50 Evolve Stacks, Item evolves and gains:\\n• Additional +Intelligence equal to 2% of Mana from Items\\n• +5 Penetration\\n• +100 Mana\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"+Intelligence equal to 5% of Mana from Items.\\n\\nDeal 900 Damage to Minions or Jungle Monsters:\\n+1 Evolve Stack\\n+1 Mana Infusion Stack (Max 50 Stacks)\\n• Damage dealt to Gods counts double\\n\\nPer Mana Infusion Stack: +10 Mana.\\n\\nAt 50 Evolve Stacks, Item evolves and gains:\\n• Additional +Intelligence equal to 2% of Mana from Items\\n• +5 Penetration\\n• +100 Mana\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2300,\"isLegacy\":false},\"151c5e85-8d27-4380-8713-b07c68caebd3\":{\"slug\":\"typhons-heart\",\"name\":\"Typhon's Heart\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_TyphonsHeart.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"MagicalPower\":80,\"LifeStealPercent\":7.5},\"passive\":\"On Minion or Jungle Kill: +1 Stack\\nOn God Kill: +30 Stacks\\nOn Assist: +15 Stacks\\n\\nAt 30 Stacks: Summon a Monster of Typhon\\n• Health = 200 (+55 per Level)\\n• Damage = 300% of your Lifesteal and 30% of your Intelligence\\n• Your Lifesteal heals the monster\\n\\nIf another would be summoned:\\n• Fully Heal current monster\\n• Buff it with +25% Health, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed (Stacks up to 5x)\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"On Minion or Jungle Kill: +1 Stack\\nOn God Kill: +30 Stacks\\nOn Assist: +15 Stacks\\n\\nAt 30 Stacks: Summon a Monster of Typhon\\n• Health = 200 (+55 per Level)\\n• Damage = 300% of your Lifesteal and 30% of your Intelligence\\n• Your Lifesteal heals the monster\\n\\nIf another would be summoned:\\n• Fully Heal current monster\\n• Buff it with +25% Health, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed (Stacks up to 5x)\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2600,\"isLegacy\":false},\"a3647b07-5c72-4e19-aa2f-8d4b00446e76\":{\"slug\":\"totem-of-death\",\"name\":\"Totem of Death\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_TotemOfDeath.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"CooldownReductionPercent\":20,\"EchoItem\":10,\"MagicalPower\":55},\"passive\":\"Each time you Echo:\\n• Deals Bonus Magical Damage equal to 10% of target's Missing Health\\n• Can only affect Gods and Jungle Bosses.\\n• Can only occur once every second.\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Each time you Echo:\\n• Deals Bonus Magical Damage equal to 10% of target's Missing Health\\n• Can only affect Gods and Jungle Bosses.\\n• Can only occur once every second.\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2800,\"isLegacy\":false},\"e1525595-6d79-415c-b59b-d7e4807a80e6\":{\"slug\":\"the-cosmic-horror\",\"name\":\"The Cosmic Horror\",\"imagePath\":\"Items/T3/Icon_T3_StaffOfCosmicHorror.png\",\"tier\":3,\"itemType\":\"Item\",\"stats\":{\"EchoItem\":20,\"MagicalPower\":55,\"MagicalPenetrationFlat\":10,\"PhysicalPenetrationFlat\":10},\"passive\":\"Each time you Echo: +1 Stack.\\n\\nAt 3 Stacks: Next time you Echo:\\n• Spawn a tentacle that deals deals Bonus Magical Damage (45% Intelligence over 1.5s)\\n• Stacks are removed when a tentacle spawns.\\n• Tentacles can spawn once every second.\\n• Tentacles will only spawn when hitting a God or Jungle Boss\",\"passiveTokens\":null,\"active\":null,\"activeTokens\":null,\"description\":\"Each time you Echo: +1 Stack.\\n\\nAt 3 Stacks: Next time you Echo:\\n• Spawn a tentacle that deals deals Bonus Magical Damage (45% Intelligence over 1.5s)\\n• Stacks are removed when a tentacle spawns.\\n• Tentacles can spawn once every second.\\n• Tentacles will only spawn when hitting a God or Jungle Boss\",\"descriptionTokens\":null,\"totalGoldCost\":2650,\